<section class="sec" id="task-result">
  <div class="sec-title">📋 TaskResult</div>
  <div class="sec-sub"><code>dataclass</code> holding a single task execution result. Decorators create it automatically — no need to create it manually. Refer here when you need to understand the internal structure.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">TaskResult</span><span class="kind cls">dataclass</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.core.trackers.base</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">Required Fields (11)</div>
